=== buried_ending ===

// Entry: Val has has_ritual_knowledge and has followed the Figure down.
// Night_5 routes here after the descent.
// Val is at the portal in the deep room.


= at_the_portal

// BEAT: Val arrives at the portal in the deep room.
// The carvings cover every surface — these are the originals, ancient, pre-mine.
// Most intact. A few cracked — hairline fractures breaking the circuit.
//   The cracking happened in 1973 when the mine broke through.
// Bex has been filling those cracks for decades. Partially. The work is recent.
// Val takes out the car keys — established Day 4 morning:
//   "keys to a car that doesn't exist anymore."
//   Metal edge against stone. Sufficient for scoring existing cracks.
//   The last trace of Val's outside life closes the portal.
// Val does NOT carve from scratch — they complete what Bex started.
// The exhale hits. First one. Val holds on.

-> sealing_ritual


= sealing_ritual

// BEAT: The sealing. Rhythm mirrors the job.
// Job was: Window bang (event) -> scream (action) -> reset (prepare)
// Ritual is: Exhale hits (event) -> hold on, survive (action) -> pause (prepare) -> score the stone (action)
// The window is not enough. Val doesn't stop.
//
// {bex_relationship >= 5: one section is already partially traced — Bex was here recently,
//   cleared the way as close as they could get}
//
// {erasure_level >= 7: Val isn't sure how much of them is doing the carving.
//   The hands know the pattern even when the rest of Val is uncertain.
//   The ritual knowledge lives below the level erasure can reach.}
//
// The portal accelerates as Val works — system straining toward capacity.
// Race: complete the pattern before the portal finishes opening.
//
// Last section: the longest crack, at the base of the wall.
// Val gets down on their knees. The final exhale is the strongest yet.
// Hold on. Pause. Score the stone.
// Connection completes.
//
// The hum stops. Not fades — stops. Immediately.
// Silence has weight.

-> buried_ascent


= buried_ascent

// BEAT: Val climbs back up.
// Descent was urgent. Ascent is just the mine.
// The smell of copper fades as Val rises.
// By the time Val reaches the upper tunnels:
//   the screaming from above is just screaming.
//   Not more real than real anymore. Not the raw source.
//   Just guests in a haunted attraction, doing what they paid to do.
//   The job. The thing Val spent five nights producing from the other side.
// Val's shoulder aches. The window shoulder. Some things don't change.

-> buried_costume_room


= buried_costume_room

// BEAT: The costume room. Bex's mirror.
// Val doesn't know what to expect — the station cleared out, maybe, like this morning.
// Bex's station: work light on.
// The lit mirror has a design traced in greasepaint:
//   the complete containment pattern, rendered carefully across the glass.
//   Not debris. Not accidental. The full symbol.
// This is the material of the surface performance — the job Bex did every night —
//   used to leave a mark in the one place Bex worked every night.
// Not maintenance. A signature.
// Bex is gone. The mark is there.

-> buried_exit


= buried_exit

// BEAT: Val walks out through the running attraction.
// Full house. The show is still running — the machine doesn't know anything changed.
// Val passes through the guest zones.
// Zone 2: Val's boo hole is occupied. The replacement actor hits the window on time.
// Zone 5: The chainsaw actor. Standard haunt send-off — there's one at every haunt.
//   Most mundane thing possible.
//   Val just sealed an ancient portal with a car key. The machine doesn't know.
// Val walks out into the parking lot.

-> buried_diner


= buried_diner

// BEAT: The diner. Gloria already knows.
// Gloria looks up when Val walks in. One look. She knows.
// She doesn't ask. Her expression changes — the particular look of someone
//   who has been waiting for a specific thing for a long time and recognizes it.
// {has_gloria_medallion: Val returns the medallion. Beat around Gloria's father.}
// Gloria puts coffee on. They sit. The diner is warm.
// Outside, The Hollows is running its last show.
// Choice: Val says it out loud ("It's done.") or they don't have to.
// Either way Gloria already knew.

-> buried_close


= buried_close

// BEAT: Quiet close.
// They finish coffee. Gloria washes up. Same sequence she's done ten thousand times.
// The hum is gone from the floor. The absence of it is something to get used to.
// The guests are laughing in the parking lot — post-haunt high.
// Nobody knows what happened underground. Nobody needs to.

-> DONE
